    refine ⟨Rr + Rs, R2 + H0, ⟨CE η, EFoot_reflB, (by seenT), (by boxT), ⟨ρ, η, c', Rr, Rs, rfl, hE, ⟨he, hck⟩, htv', hfr, rfl, retPw_skel hPS hRP (skel_subst_eq hRk th.σs 0 0 0), hDy.letW hterm rfl⟩,
